WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:01:29.133 --> 00:01:31.213
Hey Youtubers this is Charlie!

00:01:31.240 --> 00:01:35.900
So Marvel has just announced that they're developing a spin-off TV-series for Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D.

00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:38.720
That might even debut by this fall.

00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:43.460
So I'll explain what they said, how it's supposed to work and what I think those TV-shows are gonna turn into

00:01:43.980 --> 00:01:49.900
So what they said is that the spinoff show will draw from material developed in the back half of Agents Of S.H.I.E.L.D. season 2

00:01:50.240 --> 00:01:54.840
So all that stuff that is happening with the inhumans is probably what is gonna lead up into the spinoff

00:01:55.260 --> 00:01:58.160
That doesn't mean that it is inclusively going to be an inhumans show 

00:01:58.400 --> 00:02:00.600
But don't be suprised that they announced the title is inhumans

00:02:01.060 --> 00:02:01.560
I mean

00:02:01.560 --> 00:02:02.940
 talk about brand awereness

00:02:03.160 --> 00:02:03.980
In the simplest of terms

00:02:04.080 --> 00:02:07.920
ABC and Marvel are just doing the exact same thing that Arrow did when they span off The Flash

00:02:08.380 --> 00:02:09.800
What happened is that they had Barry Allen

00:02:09.800 --> 00:02:12.440
They brought him on and like in a special two-part episode

00:02:12.820 --> 00:02:14.620
 And then used that as like a litmus test

00:02:14.680 --> 00:02:15.780
To show the network

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:18.120
To say that : 'hey we wanna develop a spin-off show'

00:02:18.560 --> 00:02:21.940
The network liked it so much that they said: 'okay go ahead and do a separate pilot'

00:02:22.360 --> 00:02:23.060
The rest is history

00:02:23.180 --> 00:02:26.280
The Flash ended up being CW's biggest hit of all time

00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:28.560
Marvel wants to exploit more of their IP

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:30.660
ABC wants more popular shows

00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:34.500
So naturally they're just gonna try and mine the most interesting things that they can

00:02:34.780 --> 00:02:35.760
Right now that's inhumans

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:39.880
Just you know, big root from the comics that hasn't been explored a lot on TV and in the movies

00:02:40.480 --> 00:02:42.660
What about timing, you know, when is this show supposed to air?

00:02:42.960 --> 00:02:45.240
What they've said so far is that the plan is

00:02:45.360 --> 00:02:47.180
is that they would premier in the fall

00:02:47.260 --> 00:02:47.840
As soon as fall

00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:48.655
That doesn't mean that'll end up happening

00:02:49.260 --> 00:02:50.160
They might end up pushing it

00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:55.140
But for all intends and purposes just expect it to air alongside Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D. in the fall

00:02:55.140 --> 00:02:57.360
Just like The Flash and Arrow air on different nights

00:02:58.080 --> 00:03:00.920
I know a lot of you are asking what does this mean about Agent Carter

00:03:00.920 --> 00:03:02.840
Because Agent Carter was like their other show

00:03:02.920 --> 00:03:03.920
They haven't said anything about it

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:06.960
But they just made all these big plans for another spin-off show

00:03:07.340 --> 00:03:08.640
It doesn't mean that it's cancelled

00:03:08.940 --> 00:03:11.580
Agent Carter is still like unofficialy getting a season 2

00:03:11.980 --> 00:03:16.140
Typically May is when networks make their final decisions about which new shows they're picking up

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:17.660
And which shows they're cancelling

00:03:18.320 --> 00:03:20.320
One of the issues I think Agent Carter runs into

00:03:20.320 --> 00:03:23.420
Is that it's more about characters and less about spectacle

00:03:23.740 --> 00:03:27.300
And typically what brings in like big eyeballs all across the world

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:28.580
is the spectacle part

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:30.180
The show itself is amazing

00:03:30.240 --> 00:03:31.180
Agent Carter is great

00:03:31.320 --> 00:03:33.160
But Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D. on the other side of that coin

00:03:33.320 --> 00:03:35.580
Provides more oppurtunities for big spectacles

00:03:35.920 --> 00:03:37.440
and really personal character moments

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:39.220
The same thing happened with Arrow

00:03:39.300 --> 00:03:40.860
Whenever they first started making that show

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:42.780
It was supposed to be really dark and griddy

00:03:42.960 --> 00:03:43.900
No superpowers

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:47.260
So, like the spectacle level was turned way way down

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:48.680
A couple years later

00:03:49.180 --> 00:03:51.940
Barry Allen, superpowered individual debuts on TV

00:03:52.240 --> 00:03:52.740
Everyone loves it

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:55.740
And networks realized: 'oh we can do these crazy superpowers'

00:03:55.740 --> 00:03:57.700
And people will watch it, people really enjoy this

00:03:58.100 --> 00:04:03.420
So I feel like this is Marvel and ABC responding to people wanting to see, you know, powers versus powers

00:04:03.420 --> 00:04:05.420
As opposed to regulars versus powers

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:06.960
What about the cast though?

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:11.700
I know everyone is asking like: does that mean the characters from Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D. will transition to the new show?

00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:14.320
No, I think it'll be just like Arrow and The Flash

00:04:14.540 --> 00:04:16.940
The Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D. cast will stay on Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D.

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:17.840
What will happen is:

00:04:18.240 --> 00:04:22.480
They'll bring in like a new big character that they think can lead the spin-off show

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:24.300
And then they will build that show around them

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:29.100
Then you have characters like Sky, inhumans with powers that can jump back and forth between shows

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:33.640
And obviously Phill Coulson is always gonna jump back and forth between all the shows and all the movies

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:38.440
There is even a rumor that Coulson is gonna be the one on the Netflix shows to assemble the Defenders

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:43.620
To like go to Daredevil, Jessica Jones, Luke Cage and Iron Fist and say: 'hey, I'm putting a team together

00:04:44.040 --> 00:04:46.680
So if you haven't been watching them I recommend you check out Arrow and The Flash

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:49.880
Just to see how the characters bounce back and forth between those shows

00:04:49.880 --> 00:04:52.580
Cause I think Marvel and ABC are going to do the exact same thing

00:04:52.820 --> 00:04:55.640
Of all the possible names the could give the spin-off show

00:04:55.720 --> 00:04:58.460
There's Secret Warriors and Inhumans at the top of the list

00:04:58.920 --> 00:05:01.560
It just it depends on how on the nose they wanna be

00:05:01.580 --> 00:05:03.220
Because there's gonna be an Inhumans movie

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:07.300
So, I don't know necesarilly if they want a movie with the same name as a TV-show

00:05:07.560 --> 00:05:10.740
Although there is a Flash TV-show and there is going to be a Flash movie

00:05:10.940 --> 00:05:14.500
It really just depends on how they wanna portray all these inhuman people

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:16.840
And whether or not they are gonna do something like Terrigen bomb

00:05:17.060 --> 00:05:19.200
