We really have no idea what Marvel is gonna do to develop Inhumans inside the movie universe

00:05:29.240 --> 00:05:30.600
Before the Inhumans movie

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:31.940
We've only seen them on TV so far

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:33.400
