00:05:50.520 --> 00:05:53.280
Wouldn't that be awesome if she was on the new spin-off show? That would be badass

00:05:53.800 --> 00:05:55.040
So here's my big question for you guys:

00:05:55.360 --> 00:05:57.780
Who do you wanna see on this new spin-off show

00:05:57.780 --> 00:05:59.760
